      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "从与爱丽速子谈过以来，我每天都在不停\n搜集着关于赛马娘伤病的资料。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3cb121a2280415649b74df09ef20e1075572e2a99b35e78594b07f6b90e6ca79",
